        },
        {
          "text": "**Specific Models of Experiential Learning:** A deep dive into David Kolb's Learning Cycle or Donald Schön's \"Reflection-in-Action\" as specific, actionable models.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 107,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-applied-psychology-and-philosophy-for-personal-system-building_🆔20251028023308.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Self-Determination Theory (SDT):** A core theory in motivational psychology focusing on the three essential needs: **Autonomy, Competence, and Relatedness.**",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 112,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-applied-psychology-and-philosophy-for-personal-system-building_🆔20251028023308.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT):** A practical, therapeutic framework that directly applies many of these concepts (metacognition, self-behavioral-management) to change negative thought patterns.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 112,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-applied-psychology-and-philosophy-for-personal-system-building_🆔20251028023308.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Models of Self-Regulation:** A closer look at specific frameworks like Bandura's social cognitive theory or Carver and Scheier's control-theory model of self-regulation.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 123,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-applied-psychology-and-philosophy-for-personal-system-building_🆔20251028023308.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT):** A modern psychological approach that blends metacognitive awareness and values-based action in a way that is highly compatible with Stoic principles.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 123,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-applied-psychology-and-philosophy-for-personal-system-building_🆔20251028023308.md"
        }
      ]
